{'input': "So many people I speak to have an AI app idea but lack the motivation to make progress. Next Wednesday I'm organising a breakfast meetup with help from Talent Insights, where folks can learn from each other and hold each other accountable in shipping value for their users. I've hoodwinked Anthony Tockar into being one of the presenters, and am working on getting folks from Canva, Atlassian, and a handful of other tech startups. If you're keen to get building with AI, I'd love to have you along. The format is casual: breakfast, short demos, and supportive discussion. Perfect for connecting with fellow AI builders! Register here", 'output': {'template_id': '124822590', 'boxes[0][text]': 'AI App Ideas', 'boxes[1][text]': 'Actually Building AI Apps', 'boxes[2][text]': 'Me'}, 'prompt': 'PREVIOUS ATTEMPTS (TRY A DIFFERENT TEMPLATE):

{'template_id': '112126428', 'boxes[0][text]': 'Actually building AI apps', 'boxes[1][text]': 'Me', 'boxes[2][text]': 'Just having AI app ideas', 'username': 'yadd3', 'password': 'yeet1234!'}

